## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to craft a concrete witness in a three-valued logic setting and reason about propagation semantics under constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Kleene three-valued semantics; 
- Implication as ¬A ∨ B; 
- Backtracking/propagation to avoid F; 
- Witness construction with unknowns.

## Code Example
```javascript
// simplified 3-valued implication (T>U>F)
function imp(a,b){
  if (a==='F') return 'T';
  if (a==='U') return 'U';
  return b;
}
```

